# Mira — AI Hospitality Assistant

Mira is a conversational AI hotel assistant that understands guest requirements, searches hotel inventory, helps guests select a property and room, and guides them through a booking flow.


## Setup Instructions

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/mehakthakur/mira-hotel-agent.git
cd mira-hotel-agent

2. Create a virtual environment
python -m venv venv

Activate it on Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate

3. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

4. Configure the Gemini API
Create a .env file in the project root:
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key

The .env file should not be committed to GitHub.

5. Run Mira
python -m streamlit run app.py

The Streamlit interface will open in your browser:)

